&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Superb communication and leadership capacity; ability to partner effectively with diverse company stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
