&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BVNK is the stablecoin-powered financial stack for enterprises. We&#39;re now part of Mastercard, and together we&#39;re building a network for every form of money – one that delivers more reach, more capability and more choice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We enable businesses to build financial products, unlock new markets, and move money in seconds across 130+ countries, with 40+ licenses for fiat and digital assets globally. Processing billions annually, we empower enterprises worldwide to send, receive, convert, and settle stablecoins and fiat seamlessly through a single integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our mission is to accelerate global money movement, and we&#39;re assembling a world-class team to make it happen.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trusted by industry leaders like Corpay, Worldpay, Deel, and Flywire, we deliver the infrastructure that makes new forms of money usable within the financial systems customers already rely on today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining Mastercard&#39;s global payment reach and trusted networks with BVNK&#39;s stablecoin infrastructure, we&#39;re building the trusted operating layer for the evolution of money movement, helping customers participate in emerging digital networks without having to rebuild their businesses around every new innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a diverse team spread across EMEA, North America, and APAC, with a shared belief that stablecoins are the new infrastructure layer for financial services, and that BVNK is at the forefront of this shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re incredibly honored to have been recognized by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CNBC World&#39;s Top Fintech Companies (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FXC Intelligence Top 100 Cross-border Payment Companies (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newsweek&#39;s The Top 100 Global Most Loved Workplaces (three years running, most recently 2025)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LinkedIn as one of the Top 20 Startups in the UK (2025)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role in the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Product Manager to lead Reconciliation and Financial Reporting at BVNK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission is to make sure every movement of money across the BVNK platform, in fiat and in stablecoins, is accounted for, matched and reported correctly. You&#39;ll own our internal financial reporting engine and reconciliation platform, and make sure every product we build, including the products we&#39;re building with Mastercard, goes live with the right reconciliation and reporting in place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an operations and data-heavy product. You&#39;ll work closely with the Reconciliation Operations and Operations Delivery teams to understand where breaks and manual work come from, and turn that into a prioritised backlog. You&#39;ll also partner with finance, treasury and compliance, who rely on accurate reconciliation for safeguarding, month-end close and regulatory reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work with engineers across the payments, wallets and ledger teams on the data structures and events that reconciliation depends on, and with small, autonomous engineering squads across BVNK. We see AI as a key lever in how we build, and we expect you to use it in your day-to-day work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Areas of Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the reconciliation and reporting strategy and roadmap, from how transaction data is captured at source to the reports that finance, operations and regulators rely on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own BVNK&#39;s internal financial reporting engine, including balance, transaction, fee and safeguarding reporting, and make sure it is accurate, timely and auditable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure every new product, currency, payment rail, banking partner and blockchain network is backed by the correct reconciliation and reporting before it launches. Build reconciliation requirements into launch readiness, and work with other PMs so they are planned from the start rather than added afterwards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Reconciliation Operations and Operations Delivery teams to find the root causes of breaks, exceptions and manual workarounds, and build the backlog accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineers on the payments, wallets and events data structures, so that every transaction carries the identifiers, statuses and metadata needed to match it automatically across internal ledgers, bank and PSP statements, and on-chain activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the matching engine and exception tooling, including matching rules, break ageing and investigation workflows, and audit trails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own how external data comes into the platform, such as bank statements (for example camt.053 and MT940), PSP and liquidity provider reports, and blockchain data, along with the data quality controls around it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with finance, treasury, compliance and audit on safeguarding reconciliation, month-end close, and regulatory and audit reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in resolving reconciliation and regulatory incidents, including safeguarding incidents. When issues arise, respond quickly, work with Operations, Engineering, Finance and Compliance to find the cause and fix it, and follow up with product changes that stop it happening again.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear PRDs, user stories and acceptance criteria, and see work through to release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track the measures that matter, such as auto-match rate, number and age of open breaks, time to resolve, reporting timeliness and manual effort. Use data to decide what to build next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we need from you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of product management experience in payments, banking or fintech, ideally owning reconciliation, ledger, finance or reporting products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid technical knowledge. You&#39;re comfortable working with engineers on data models, ledgers, event-driven systems, APIs and data pipelines, and you can reason about technical trade-offs without needing to write the code. You&#39;re happy to query data yourself using SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of reconciliation and financial reporting: double-entry accounting, transaction lifecycles, settlement, matching logic and why breaks happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in operations, or working closely with operations teams. You understand how exceptions and manual processes are handled day to day, and you build products that reduce them. When something goes wrong, you respond quickly and stay calm under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the payments and/or banking industry, for example with payment schemes such as SEPA, ACH, Faster Payments or SWIFT, bank statement formats, or settlement with banks and PSPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills. You write clearly, present confidently to senior leaders and explain complex topics simply to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to build and articulate plans, and to align and communicate on them with other PMs and stakeholders. You manage dependencies across teams, handle competing priorities and can say no with a clear rationale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity. You create structure where requirements are still evolving and keep complex work moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-native mindset. You&#39;re an early adopter of AI tools and agentic workflows, and you use them to research, analyse, write specifications and design solutions, not just to summarise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with stablecoins, blockchain networks or crypto operations, including on-chain reconciliation of wallets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or replacing a reconciliation platform, either in-house or with a vendor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with safeguarding or regulatory reporting for e-money or payment institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with products that run across several regulated entities or jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you can expect from us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fair and &lt;strong&gt;competitive salary&lt;/strong&gt; at every stage of your growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible working&lt;/strong&gt; hours, with hybrid working at its heart&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;culture&lt;/strong&gt; built on passionate, growth-minded people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;flexible approach to holiday&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to travel to our &lt;strong&gt;offices around the world&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;open and creative environment&lt;/strong&gt; where you can help us define the future of BVNK, its culture, and its opportunity sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At BVNK, we are focused on building a diverse and inclusive team. While you may not meet all of our requirements, we’d encourage you to apply if you meet the majority of our expectations. You may be a great fit for this role or another role in our team. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation packages are based on candidate experience and relevant certifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Bulgaria Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€75.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€100.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation packages are based on candidate experience and relevant certifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€75.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€120.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation packages are based on candidate experience and relevant certifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Malta Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€75.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€110.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation packages are based on candidate experience and relevant certifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Poland Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;330 000 zł&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;420 000 zł PLN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BVNK is the stablecoin-powered financial stack for enterprises. We&#39;re now part of Mastercard, and together we&#39;re building a network for every form of money – one that delivers more reach, more capability and more choice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We enable businesses to build financial products, unlock new markets, and move money in seconds across 130+ countries, with 40+ licenses for fiat and digital assets globally. Processing billions annually, we empower enterprises worldwide to send, receive, convert, and settle stablecoins and fiat seamlessly through a single integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our mission is to accelerate global money movement, and we&#39;re assembling a world-class team to make it happen.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trusted by industry leaders like Corpay, Worldpay, Deel, and Flywire, we deliver the infrastructure that makes new forms of money usable within the financial systems customers already rely on today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining Mastercard&#39;s global payment reach and trusted networks with BVNK&#39;s stablecoin infrastructure, we&#39;re building the trusted operating layer for the evolution of money movement, helping customers participate in emerging digital networks without having to rebuild their businesses around every new innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a diverse team spread across EMEA, North America, and APAC, with a shared belief that stablecoins are the new infrastructure layer for financial services, and that BVNK is at the forefront of this shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re incredibly honored to have been recognized by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CNBC World&#39;s Top Fintech Companies (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FXC Intelligence Top 100 Cross-border Payment Companies (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newsweek&#39;s The Top 100 Global Most Loved Workplaces (three years running, most recently 2025)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LinkedIn as one of the Top 20 Startups in the UK (2025)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: We offer a Hybrid/Remote working policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FUNCTION:&lt;/strong&gt; Product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Product Manager to join our Fiat product team and own the operational backbone of our fiat payment flows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every day, BVNK moves money for enterprise customers across SEPA, SWIFT, ACH, RTGS and instant payment schemes. Getting a payment out of the door is only half the job. What happens next (a return, a recall, a rejected payment, a compliance hold, an investigation or a customer query) is where trust is won or lost. Your mission is to make those processes fast, reliable, automated and compliant, at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own the product strategy for the post-initiation and exception lifecycle of fiat payments: returns, recalls, rejections, repairs, investigations, compliance-driven holds and releases, and the tooling our operations teams use to manage them. You&#39;ll work hand in hand with payment operations, compliance, financial crime, treasury, finance and our banking partners to turn manual processes into well-designed product capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner with senior product managers, engineers and architects and with small, autonomous engineering squads, and you&#39;ll take products from discovery and design all the way through to launch. We see AI as a key lever in how we build and operate, and we expect you to use it in your day-to-day work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Areas of Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product strategy and roadmap for FIAT payment operations, covering the full exception lifecycle of payment flows across all schemes we support: SEPA (SCT and SCT Inst), SWIFT, ACH, Fedwire, FedNow, RTP and Faster Payments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver scheme-compliant handling of returns, recalls, rejections, cancellations, payment repairs and investigations, including the related ISO 20022 messages (e.g. pacs.004, camt.056, camt.029) and their equivalents on non-ISO rails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build compliance processes into payment flows from the start: sanctions and transaction screening outcomes, holds and releases, Requests for Information (RFIs), Verification of Payee / Confirmation of Payee, Travel Rule and fraud-related recalls, working closely with Operation, compliance and financial crime teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive straight-through processing and automation. Reduce manual intervention, define clear exception queues and SLAs, and give operations teams the internal tools, workflows and visibility they need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the ledger, reconciliation, treasury and reporting stay correct when a payment changes state, so funds are reversed, returned or re-credited accurately and customers are informed through clear API events, webhooks and statuses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the full product lifecycle from discovery to launch: problem definition, user research with internal and external users, solution design, PRDs, user stories and acceptance criteria, delivery with engineering, launch readiness, go-to-market, pricing input, documentation and enablement for sales and support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with banking partners and scheme providers to understand rulebooks, cut-offs and scheme changes, and translate them into product requirements. Keep BVNK ahead of regulatory and scheme updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track the measures that matter, such as exception rates, time to resolve returns and recalls, recall success rates, STP rates, operational cost per transaction, SLA adherence and customer satisfaction. Use data to decide what to build next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure capabilities are built once, on one shared BVNK platform, so every scheme, entity and partner benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we need from you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of product management experience, including owning complex B2B products in payments or fintech end-to-end, from discovery and design through to launch and commercialisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of a product framework you&#39;ve applied in practice: discovery, prioritisation, delivery, launch, go-to-market and post-launch iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with fiat payment schemes such as SEPA, SEPA Instant, SWIFT, ACH, Fedwire, FedNow, RTP and Faster Payments, and a deep understanding of how payments behave after initiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with payment operations processes: returns, recalls, rejections, investigations, exceptions and reconciliation. You know the scheme rules, reason codes and timelines, and you know where things break in practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building compliance- and operations-heavy products in regulated environments, working closely with compliance, financial crime and operations teams on topics such as sanctions screening, payment holds, RFIs and fraud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical skills. You&#39;re comfortable working with engineers on APIs, ledgers, event-driven systems, payment messaging (ISO 20022, JSON), data models and integrations, and you can reason about technical trade-offs without needing to write the code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills. You write clearly, present confidently to senior leaders, explain complex topics simply, and keep operations, compliance, engineering and commercial teams aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity. You bring structure to complex, cross-functional problems and keep things moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-native mindset. You&#39;re an early adopter of AI tools and agentic workflows, and you use them to research, analyse, write specifications and design solutions, including spotting where AI can automate operational work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: experience building internal operations tooling, case management or workflow products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: experience working directly with sponsor banks, payment service providers or scheme operators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: experience with products that run across several regulated entities or jurisdictions (e.g. UK, EU, US).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you can expect from us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fair and&lt;strong&gt; competitive salary &lt;/strong&gt;at every stage of your growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible&lt;/strong&gt; working hours, with hybrid working at its heart&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;culture&lt;/strong&gt; built on passionate, growth-minded people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;flexible&lt;/strong&gt; approach to holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to travel to our &lt;strong&gt;offices around the world&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;open and creative environment&lt;/strong&gt; where you can help us define the future of BVNK, its culture, and its opportunity sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At BVNK, we are focused on building a diverse and inclusive team. While you may not meet all of our requirements, we’d encourage you to apply if you meet the majority of our expectations. You may be a great fit for this role or another role in our team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation packages are based on candidate experience and relevant certifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Bulgaria Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€75.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€100.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation packages are based on candidate experience and relevant certifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€75.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€120.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation packages are based on candidate experience and relevant certifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Malta Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€75.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€110.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation packages are based on candidate experience and relevant certifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Poland Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;330 000 zł&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;420 000 zł PLN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BVNK is the stablecoin-powered financial stack for enterprises. We&#39;re now part of Mastercard, and together we&#39;re building a network for every form of money – one that delivers more reach, more capability and more choice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We enable businesses to build financial products, unlock new markets, and move money in seconds across 130+ countries, with 40+ licenses for fiat and digital assets globally. Processing billions annually, we empower enterprises worldwide to send, receive, convert, and settle stablecoins and fiat seamlessly through a single integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our mission is to accelerate global money movement, and we&#39;re assembling a world-class team to make it happen.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trusted by industry leaders like Corpay, Worldpay, Deel, and Flywire, we deliver the infrastructure that makes new forms of money usable within the financial systems customers already rely on today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining Mastercard&#39;s global payment reach and trusted networks with BVNK&#39;s stablecoin infrastructure, we&#39;re building the trusted operating layer for the evolution of money movement, helping customers participate in emerging digital networks without having to rebuild their businesses around every new innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a diverse team spread across EMEA, North America, and APAC, with a shared belief that stablecoins are the new infrastructure layer for financial services, and that BVNK is at the forefront of this shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re incredibly honored to have been recognized by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CNBC World&#39;s Top Fintech Companies (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FXC Intelligence Top 100 Cross-border Payment Companies (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newsweek&#39;s The Top 100 Global Most Loved Workplaces (three years running, most recently 2025)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LinkedIn as one of the Top 20 Startups in the UK (2025)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role in the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are currently looking for a Senior Crypto Analyst to join our fast growing FCI team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Financial Crime Intelligence Analyst, you&#39;ll play a key role in handling screening and transaction monitoring alerts to prevent bad actors from processing transactions through BVNK. You’ll also conduct in-depth analysis and thorough investigations to address complex and varied financial crime threats. You’ll be taking ownership of cases triggered by BVNK’s financial crime systems and controls, focussing primarily on BVNK’s digital assets offering, and mitigating financial crime risks for BVNK. While this role focuses on BVNK’s digital assets offering, your cases will inevitably crossover with the world of fiat currency and you’ll have the opportunity to support cutting-edge investigations in fiat and digital assets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are seeking a candidate who can commit to a full-time schedule working from 9 a.m. to 6 p.m. (CEST).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a team player; someone who is adaptable and enjoys solving complex problems in a constantly changing environment. You must be adept at managing competing priorities, and work well in a highly demanding environment. You will be comfortable delivering high quality investigations at pace, and presenting your findings and recommendations to senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Senior Financial Crime Intelligence Analyst, your day-to-day role will be varied, but will include tasks such as:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing of sanctions and watchlist screening alerts on entities and individuals on relevant lists;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management of end-to-end financial crime investigations stemming from BVNK’s transaction monitoring system, Trade Surveillance, payment screening tools, blockchain analytics provider, and other triggers;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve workflows and business processes through the effective use of AI tools and automation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receiving escalations from, and providing coaching to, more junior team members;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drafting of Suspicious Activity Reports (SARs) for submission to the relevant authorities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with colleagues responsible for BVNK’s transaction monitoring systems; identifying and testing changes to the rules in our transaction monitoring system;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seeking out and escalating opportunities to enhance BVNK’s control environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’d love to hear from you if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 3 years’ experience in crypto transaction monitoring within a regulated institution or digital assets setting. Experience in a B2B context is essential, as we are primarily a B2B business. Familiarity with B2C environments is a plus, and experience across both crypto and fiat transaction monitoring environments would be advantageous;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience reviewing sanctions and watchlist screening alerts, within a regulated institution or digital asset setting;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience using tools such as Chainalysis, Elliptic, or TRM (or equivalent). Any blockchain related investigative certifications are desirable but not required;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI tools and technologies to streamline processes, automate routine tasks, and drive operational improvements;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of AML/CTF regulations, financial crime typologies, and risk-based compliance frameworks is required;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Trade Surveillance would be an asset;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve drafted and submitted Suspicious Activity Reports (SARs);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a motivated and proactive individual contributor, who takes pride in the quality of your work;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable working in a fast-paced, evolving and demanding environment, often with competing priorities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re happy working with a high degree of autonomy and managing evolving priorities to deliver against the team&#39;s strategy;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an interest in digital assets, and are looking for an opportunity to expand your knowledge in this space;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have exceptional written and verbal English;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you can expect from us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fair and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;competitive salary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;at every stage of your growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible working&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;hours, with hybrid working at its heart&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;culture&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;built on passionate growth-minded people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;flexible approach to holiday&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to travel to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;offices around the world&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;open and creative environment&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;where you can help us define the future of BVNK, its culture, and its opportunity sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At BVNK, we are focused on building a diverse and inclusive team. While you may not meet all of our requirements, we’d encourage you to apply if you meet the majority of our expectations. You may be a great fit for this role or another role in our team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
